{"words": [{"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translation": "Those who"}, {"text": "يَظُنُّونَ", "translation": "believe"}, {"text": "أَنَّهُم", "translation": "that they"}, {"text": "مُّلَـٰقُوا۟", "translation": "will meet"}, {"text": "رَبِّهِمْ", "translation": "their Lord"}, {"text": "وَأَنَّهُمْ", "translation": "and that they"}, {"text": "إِلَيْهِ", "translation": "to Him"}, {"text": "رَٰجِعُونَ", "translation": "will return"}], "sahih": "Who are certain that they will meet their Lord and that they will return to Him."}